# Ignore unexpected root content, especially new private account folders.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/GUIDE.html
!/LICENSE
!/SECURITY.md
!/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!/index.html
!/assets/
!/archived_emails/
# Demo files tracked in Git stay tracked. Never auto-add new real emails or catalogs.
/archived_emails/**
!/docs/
!/scripts/
!/tests/
archive.lock
**/*.crswap
**/*.test-write
**/import-*.json
node_modules/
# This cannot prevent secrets in tracked files: use a separate private archive root.
